    "detailed_description": "<strong>Relax and immerse yourself in dozens of hand-crafted movement puzzles that will challenge your mind and soothe your senses.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/29b6f156086dccf3197b8028c05261f9.poster.avif?t=1684756764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/29b6f156086dccf3197b8028c05261f9.webm?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/29b6f156086dccf3197b8028c05261f9.mp4?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Link your movement with different shapes. Unlock switches. Reveal the path.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/394dac49bb27af5ff2340ca4128a00e7.poster.avif?t=1684756764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/394dac49bb27af5ff2340ca4128a00e7.webm?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/394dac49bb27af5ff2340ca4128a00e7.mp4?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Reach the checkpoint to complete the puzzle. Easy to learn, difficult to master.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/2c9f9d96c29f3e656daa8add335c32a6.poster.avif?t=1684756764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/2c9f9d96c29f3e656daa8add335c32a6.webm?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/2c9f9d96c29f3e656daa8add335c32a6.mp4?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Relax and immerse yourself in dozens of hand-crafted movement puzzles that will challenge your mind and soothe your senses.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/29b6f156086dccf3197b8028c05261f9.poster.avif?t=1684756764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/29b6f156086dccf3197b8028c05261f9.webm?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/29b6f156086dccf3197b8028c05261f9.mp4?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Link your movement with different shapes. Unlock switches. Reveal the path.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/394dac49bb27af5ff2340ca4128a00e7.poster.avif?t=1684756764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/394dac49bb27af5ff2340ca4128a00e7.webm?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/394dac49bb27af5ff2340ca4128a00e7.mp4?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Reach the checkpoint to complete the puzzle. Easy to learn, difficult to master.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/2c9f9d96c29f3e656daa8add335c32a6.poster.avif?t=1684756764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327490/extras/2c9f9d96c29f3e656daa8add335c32a6.webm?t=1684756764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp